{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "period of sin(x):\n  fundamental period 2*pi ≈ 6.283185307\n  proved symbolically: sin(x) has period 2*pi; x occurs only inside them, so f(x + p) = f(x).  Smallest: no p/k (2 <= k <= 64) is a period (checked at 997 points)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "period", "ucas": "period sin(x)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "period", "var": "x", "status": "periodic", "period": {"value": 6.283185307179586, "exact": "2*pi"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "proved symbolically: sin(x) has period 2*pi; x occurs only inside them, so f(x + p) = f(x).  Smallest: no p/k (2 <= k <= 64) is a period (checked at 997 points)"}, "files": [], "text": "period of sin(x):\n  fundamental period 2*pi ≈ 6.283185307\n  proved symbolically: sin(x) has period 2*pi; x occurs only inside them, so f(x + p) = f(x).  Smallest: no p/k (2 <= k <= 64) is a period (checked at 997 points)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 6, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "period of tan(x):\n  fundamental period pi ≈ 3.141592654\n  proved symbolically: tan(x) has period pi; x occurs only inside them, so f(x + p) = f(x).  Smallest: no p/k (2 <= k <= 64) is a period (checked at 997 points)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 6, "ok": true, "cmd": "period", "ucas": "period tan(x)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "period", "var": "x", "status": "periodic", "period": {"value": 3.141592653589793, "exact": "pi"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "proved symbolically: tan(x) has period pi; x occurs only inside them, so f(x + p) = f(x).  Smallest: no p/k (2 <= k <= 64) is a period (checked at 997 points)"}, "files": [], "text": "period of tan(x):\n  fundamental period pi ≈ 3.141592654\n  proved symbolically: tan(x) has period pi; x occurs only inside them, so f(x + p) = f(x).  Smallest: no p/k (2 <= k <= 64) is a period (checked at 997 points)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 7, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "period of sin(x)^2:\n  fundamental period pi ≈ 3.141592654\n  sin(x) has period 2*pi; so 2*pi ≈ 6.283185307 is a period (proved symbolically); its 1/2 also is, checked numerically at 997 points (not proved), and no smaller fraction is\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 7, "ok": true, "cmd": "period", "ucas": "period sin(x)^2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "period", "var": "x", "status": "periodic", "period": {"value": 3.141592653589793, "exact": "pi"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "numeric", "text": "sin(x) has period 2*pi; so 2*pi ≈ 6.283185307 is a period (proved symbolically); its 1/2 also is, checked numerically at 997 points (not proved), and no smaller fraction is"}, "files": [], "text": "period of sin(x)^2:\n  fundamental period pi ≈ 3.141592654\n  sin(x) has period 2*pi; so 2*pi ≈ 6.283185307 is a period (proved symbolically); its 1/2 also is, checked numerically at 997 points (not proved), and no smaller fraction is\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 8, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "parity of sin(x) + cos(x):\n  neither even nor odd\n  not even: f(x) = 1.381773291, f(-x) = -0.3011686789 at x = 1\n  not odd: f(x) = 1.381773291, f(-x) = -0.3011686789 at x = 1\n  checked numerically at 2000 points of [-10, 10]\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 8, "ok": true, "cmd": "parity", "ucas": "parity sin(x)+cos(x)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "parity", "not_even": "f(x) = 1.381773291, f(-x) = -0.3011686789 at x = 1", "not_odd": "f(x) = 1.381773291, f(-x) = -0.3011686789 at x = 1", "headline": "parity of sin(x) + cos(x):", "details": ["neither even nor odd", "checked numerically at 2000 points of [-10, 10]"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "parity of sin(x) + cos(x):\n  neither even nor odd\n  not even: f(x) = 1.381773291, f(-x) = -0.3011686789 at x = 1\n  not odd: f(x) = 1.381773291, f(-x) = -0.3011686789 at x = 1\n  checked numerically at 2000 points of [-10, 10]\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 9, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "bounded atan(x):\n  bounded (on all real x)\n  above: proved by interval arithmetic: f <= 1.570796327; the largest value seen is 1.471127674 at x = 10\n  below: proved by interval arithmetic: f >= -1.570796327; the smallest value seen is -1.471127674 at x = -10\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 9, "ok": true, "cmd": "bounded", "ucas": "bounded atan(x)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "bounded", "above": "proved by interval arithmetic: f <= 1.570796327; the largest value seen is 1.471127674 at x = 10", "below": "proved by interval arithmetic: f >= -1.570796327; the smallest value seen is -1.471127674 at x = -10", "headline": "bounded atan(x):", "details": ["bounded (on all real x)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "bounded atan(x):\n  bounded (on all real x)\n  above: proved by interval arithmetic: f <= 1.570796327; the largest value seen is 1.471127674 at x = 10\n  below: proved by interval arithmetic: f >= -1.570796327; the smallest value seen is -1.471127674 at x = -10\n"}, "isError": false}}
