{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 13, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Maclaurin (Taylor at 0) series of sin(x) at x = 0, through order 7:\n  sin(x) = x - x^3/6 + x^5/120 - x^7/5040 + O(x^8)\n  as x -> 0; coefficients c_k = f^(k)(0)/k!: 0 1 0 -1/6 0 1/120 0 -1/5040\n  check: the coefficients agree with Taylor-jet arithmetic (long double) to 0\n  check: |f - P| = 2.76e-15 at x = 0 ± 1/10, 5.38e-18 at ± 1/20, 1.02e-20 at ± 1/40 (at rounding level)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 13, "ok": true, "cmd": "taylor", "ucas": "taylor sin(x) x at 0 order 7", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "taylor", "var": "x", "at": 0, "order": 7, "polynomial": "x - x^3/6 + x^5/120 - x^7/5040", "coefficients": ["0", "1", "0", "-1/6", "0", "1/120", "0", "-1/5040"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "taylor_jet", "points": 8, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "coefficients against long double Taylor-jet arithmetic"}], "files": [], "text": "Maclaurin (Taylor at 0) series of sin(x) at x = 0, through order 7:\n  sin(x) = x - x^3/6 + x^5/120 - x^7/5040 + O(x^8)\n  as x -> 0; coefficients c_k = f^(k)(0)/k!: 0 1 0 -1/6 0 1/120 0 -1/5040\n  check: the coefficients agree with Taylor-jet arithmetic (long double) to 0\n  check: |f - P| = 2.76e-15 at x = 0 ± 1/10, 5.38e-18 at ± 1/20, 1.02e-20 at ± 1/40 (at rounding level)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 14, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "limit of tan(x) as x -> pi/2:\n  from the left:\n  = inf\n  from the right:\n  = -inf\n  the one-sided limits differ: the (two-sided) limit does not exist\n  numeric from the left (a - h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 6.313751515, 101.8558911, 1629.746413, 26075.94586, 417215.134, 13350884.28\n    the values grow without bound (+): agrees\n  numeric from the right (a + h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): -6.313751515, -101.8558911, -1629.746413, -26075.94586, -417215.134, -13350884.3\n    the values grow without bound (-): agrees\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 14, "ok": true, "cmd": "limit", "ucas": "limit tan(x) as x -> (pi/2)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "limit", "var": "x", "at": "pi/2", "side": "both", "left": {"kind": "+inf", "text": "inf"}, "right": {"kind": "-inf", "text": "-inf"}, "limit": {"kind": "does not exist", "text": "the one-sided limits differ"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "limit of tan(x) as x -> pi/2:\n  from the left:\n  = inf\n  from the right:\n  = -inf\n  the one-sided limits differ: the (two-sided) limit does not exist\n  numeric from the left (a - h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 6.313751515, 101.8558911, 1629.746413, 26075.94586, 417215.134, 13350884.28\n    the values grow without bound (+): agrees\n  numeric from the right (a + h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): -6.313751515, -101.8558911, -1629.746413, -26075.94586, -417215.134, -13350884.3\n    the values grow without bound (-): agrees\n"}, "isError": false}}
